# "Creatures your opponents control get -1/-1" (CR 613.4c): Bot2 controls a Llanowar Elves (1/1) and an Ornithopter (0/2); Bot1 has its own
# Ornithopter. When M.O.D.O.K. enters on turn 3 the Elves becomes 0/0 and is put into the graveyard (CR 704.5f), Bot2's Ornithopter is -1/1, and
# Bot1's own Ornithopter is untouched at 0/2, as is M.O.D.O.K. itself (2/2). Then Bot1 kills its own M.O.D.O.K. with a Lightning Bolt: the effect ends
# with it and Bot2's Ornithopter is a 0/2 again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
M.O.D.O.K.
Ornithopter
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Ornithopter
Forest x4
Forest x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.M.O.D.O.K..Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = -1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.M.O.D.O.K..Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.M.O.D.O.K..Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(M.O.D.O.K.)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = M.O.D.O.K.; Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
